</style><defs><linearGradient id="automate-ai-icon-gradient-8379" x1="-0.585035" y1="23.4667" x2="25.4345" y2="23.3392" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop stop-color="#0066C3"></stop><stop offset="0.111111" stop-color="#1C5BBE"></stop><stop offset="0.222222" stop-color="#2F4EB8"></stop><stop offset="0.333333" stop-color="#3E41B1"></stop><stop offset="0.444444" stop-color="#4C31A7"></stop><stop offset="0.555556" stop-color="#4C2796"></stop><stop offset="0.666667" stop-color="#42247E"></stop><stop offset="0.777778" stop-color="#382067"></stop><stop offset="0.888889" stop-color="#2E1C51"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#24183B"></stop></linearGradient></defs></svg><span font-size="xSmall" class="EnhancedWithHouzzAI__GradientText-is6qly-0 gYXBBr pro-plan-feature-group-list__ai-footer-text">Enhanced with Houzz AI</span></div></div></div></div></div><div height="16px" class="sc-183mtny-0 brYOJy"></div><div display="flex" class="sc-183mtny-0 XWYfm">Want to try out basic Houzz tools?<button class="btn  hz-pro-solutions-button hz-pro-solutions-button--link hz-track-me action-button PlanChooserMobile__BasicPlanCTA-sc-1no4y35-4 jrivGI plan-card-section__basic-banner-cta saas-mono" role="button" data-component="Basic Option" data-testid="Basic-action-btn" data-entity-id="Basic Tools" data-cta="Basic Tools" theme="[object Object]" type="button">Try Our Free Basic Plan</button></div><div data-container="Plan and Pricing Options" class="sc-183mtny-0 fiQGwT"><h2 font-weight="bold" font-size="large,mega" class="sc-1hirnpv-0 bdDgbB sc-mwxddt-0 dDqSOf">Here’s an add-on</h2><div display="flex" width="100%" class="sc-183mtny-0 RUXOY"><div display="flex" order="2,2,2,1" class="sc-183mtny-0 gIvbZH"><h2 font-weight="bold" font-size="medium,medium,medium,large" class="sc-1hirnpv-0 bdDgbB sc-mwxddt-0 bYZMWg">Add an Advertising Package</h2><p font-size="xSmall,small" class="sc-mwxddt-0 lhsMmK">Stand out to local, hiring homeowners with targeted ads tailored to your business.</p><p font-size="14" color="content.secondary" class="sc-mwxddt-0 fLxwyN"><span>Starting at <strong>$499/mo</strong></span></p><div class="sc-183mtny-0 eJboed"><button class="btn  hz-pro-solutions-button hz-pro-solutions-button--primary-outline hz-track-me AdvertisingPlanCardWrapper__StyledCta-z01657-0 kFIKGJ" role="button" data-event-type="Element Viewed" data-component="Demo Button" data-testid="Ultimate-demo-btn" target="_blank" data-cta="Get Pricing" data-objid="Ultimate" type="button">Get Pricing</button></div></div><div display="flex" order="1,1,1,2" class="sc-183mtny-0 cLbzWj"><img src="https://st.hzcdn.com/static/pro-solutions/advertising_plan_card%401x.png" srcSet="https://st.hzcdn.com/static/pro-solutions/advertising_plan_card%401x.png 1x, https://st.hzcdn.com/static/pro-solutions/advertising_plan_card%402x.png 2x" maxWidth="258" maxHeight="168" class="AdvertisingPlanCard__StyledRetinaImage-sc-1x4p2bd-0 liaJMj"/></div></div></div></section></section></section></section><div display="flex" data-section="Banner" class="sc-183mtny-0 BIXJd"><div display="grid" data-container="Houzz Pro ROI Calculator" data-event-type="Element Viewed" data-extra-info="{&quot;experienceName&quot;:&quot;pricing-v2&quot;}" class="sc-183mtny-0 hcyfZd"><div display="flex" class="sc-183mtny-0 kIJCNY"><h2 font-weight="bold" font-size="xSmall,xSmall,small" color="neutral.white" letter-spacing="1.25px" class="sc-1hirnpv-0 bdDgbB sc-mwxddt-0 dmcbAs">ROI CALCULATOR</h2><h1 font-weight="bold" font-size="xLarge,xLarge,megaPlus" color="neutral.white" class="sc-1hirnpv-0 bdDgbB sc-mwxddt-0 bgMMev">Calculate Your Estimated ROI</h1><p font-size="small,small,smallPlus" color="neutral.white" class="sc-mwxddt-0 fDnQZU">How much potential ROI could you gain with Houzz Pro? Let&#x27;s find out.</p><a href="https://www.houzz.com/houzz-pro/roi-calculator?sourceName=pricing-v2" rel="noopener" class="sc-1qppj2g-0 cdoImM hui-btn hz-track-me" shape="default" data-active="false" data-loading="false" aria-disabled="false" target="_blank" data-component="Estimate ROI">Estimate My ROI</a></div><div class="sc-183mtny-0 gXzLxR"><div class="sc-183mtny-0 cvulwm is-example"><div class="sc-183mtny-0 kQkVqC"><h3 font-weight="bold" font-size="12px,12px,16px" color="neutral.fullBlack" class="sc-1hirnpv-0 bdDgbB sc-mwxddt-0 dEeALj">Your potential annual revenue increase*</h3><h2 font-weight="bold" font-size="44px,44px,60px" color="green.shade2" class="sc-1hirnpv-0 bdDgbB sc-mwxddt-0 lcmuYy">$195,721</h2></div><ul display="flex" class="sc-183mtny-0 cTpUFl"><li display="flex" class="sc-183mtny-0 ResultTableV2__RevenueBreakdownItem-sc-11hsvzd-1 hmzXGu gGQEWT"><div display="flex" class="sc-183mtny-0 jgpPhP"><h2 font-weight="bold" class="sc-1hirnpv-0 bdDgbB sc-mwxddt-0 dEeALj label" font-size="12px,12px,16px" color="neutral.fullBlack">Annual revenue increase by percentage</h2></div><span class="sc-mwxddt-0 hKFFgU value" display="flex" font-size="small" color="neutral.fullBlack">39%<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12px" color="green.shade2" display="inline-block" focusable="false" role="img" aria-hidden="true" height="12px" class="houzz-icon sc-hp3fbs-0 jzHmwl"><path d="M14.293 8.70701L9 3.41401V16H7V3.41401L1.707 8.70701L0.292999 7.29301L7.293 0.293006C7.684 -0.0979941 8.316 -0.0979941 8.707 0.293006L15.707 7.29301L14.293 8.70701Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></li><li display="none,none,flex" class="sc-183mtny-0 ResultTableV2__RevenueBreakdownItem-sc-11hsvzd-1 ifukC gGQEWT"><div display="flex" class="sc-183mtny-0 jgpPhP"><h2 font-weight="bold" class="sc-1hirnpv-0 bdDgbB sc-mwxddt-0 dEeALj label" font-size="12px,12px,16px" color="neutral.fullBlack">Revenue from additional projects</h2></div><span class="sc-mwxddt-0 hKFFgU value" display="flex" font-size="small" color="neutral.fullBlack">$156,294</span></li><li display="none,none,flex" class="sc-183mtny-0 ResultTableV2__RevenueBreakdownItem-sc-11hsvzd-1 ifukC gGQEWT"><div display="flex" class="sc-183mtny-0 jgpPhP"><h2 font-weight="bold" class="sc-1hirnpv-0 bdDgbB sc-mwxddt-0 dEeALj label" font-size="12px,12px,16px" color="neutral.fullBlack">Revenue from per project upcharge</h2></div><span class="sc-mwxddt-0 hKFFgU value" display="flex" font-size="small" color="neutral.fullBlack">$39,428</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="sc-183mtny-0 evaXNd"><p color="neutral.white" font-size="xSmall" class="sc-mwxddt-0 fbdiGW">Image above shown for illustration purposes only. Results may vary. Click &#x27;Estimate My ROI&#x27; to calculate the ROI that applies to you.</p></div></div></div><section class="questions pricing-content__questionsV2" data-section="questions_section" data-container="Questions"><section class="marketing-container "><h1 class="questions-title text-center">Frequently asked questions</h1><div class="question-list"><section class="accordion"><div data-pos-id="0" data-cta="Who is Houzz Pro for?"><section class="hz-panel hz-panel--collapsible hz-panel--collapsed"><button class="hz-panel__header-btn hz-track-me hz-panel__header hz-color-link hz-color-link--static hz-color-link--enabled " tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="hz-color-link__text " role="link" tabindex="0" data-unmask="false">Who is Houzz Pro for?</span><span class="icon-font icon-chevron_thin_right hz-panel__toggle hz-panel__toggle--right hz-color-link__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="hz-panel__content" aria-hidden="true"><div>Houzz Pro is packed with industry-leading tools to serve professionals across the home remodeling and design industry. Consider it your new time-saving, project-managing business hub!</div></div></section></div><div data-pos-id="1" data-cta="How does the 30-day free trial work?"><section class="hz-panel hz-panel--collapsible hz-panel--collapsed"><button class="hz-panel__header-btn hz-track-me hz-panel__header hz-color-link hz-color-link--static hz-color-link--enabled " tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="hz-color-link__text " role="link" tabindex="0" data-unmask="false">How does the 30-day free trial work?</span><span class="icon-font icon-chevron_thin_right hz-panel__toggle hz-panel__toggle--right hz-color-link__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="hz-panel__content" aria-hidden="true"><div>You can use Houzz Pro free for 30 days! You can cancel anytime during the free 30-day trial before your annual subscription begins at the end of the free trial. Ready to get started? Woo hoo! <a class='hz-pro-solutions-link hz-pro-solutions-link--blue hz-color-link hz-color-link--none hz-color-link--enabled hz-track-me' data-compid='demo_btn' href='https://www.houzz.com/houzz-pro/pricing' target='_blank'>Click here.</a></div></div></section></div><div data-pos-id="2" data-cta="How much does Houzz Pro cost?"><section class="hz-panel hz-panel--collapsible hz-panel--collapsed"><button class="hz-panel__header-btn hz-track-me hz-panel__header hz-color-link hz-color-link--static hz-color-link--enabled " tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="hz-color-link__text " role="link" tabindex="0" data-unmask="false">How much does Houzz Pro cost?</span><span class="icon-font icon-chevron_thin_right hz-panel__toggle hz-panel__toggle--right hz-color-link__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="hz-panel__content" aria-hidden="true"><div>The cost of Houzz Pro depends on which plan you choose. We have affordable options available for every business. See the different plan types <a class='hz-pro-solutions-link hz-pro-solutions-link--blue hz-color-link hz-color-link--none hz-color-link--enabled hz-track-me' data-compid='demo_btn' href='https://www.houzz.com/houzz-pro/pricing' target='_blank'>here</a> and choose the best option for you. </div></div></section></div><div data-pos-id="3" data-cta="Can I accept online payments from my customers using Houzz Pro?"><section class="hz-panel hz-panel--collapsible hz-panel--collapsed"><button class="hz-panel__header-btn hz-track-me hz-panel__header hz-color-link hz-color-link--static hz-color-link--enabled " tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="hz-color-link__text " role="link" tabindex="0" data-unmask="false">Can I accept online payments from my customers using Houzz Pro?</span><span class="icon-font icon-chevron_thin_right hz-panel__toggle hz-panel__toggle--right hz-color-link__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="hz-panel__content" aria-hidden="true"><div>You bet! Your clients can pay you directly through Houzz Pro via credit card, debit card, or ACH (bank transfer). It’s easy to get set up, clients love the convenience, and everything is tracked in Houzz Pro.</div></div></section></div><div data-pos-id="4" data-cta="I’m ready to sign up. Where do I start?"><section class="hz-panel hz-panel--collapsible hz-panel--collapsed"><button class="hz-panel__header-btn hz-track-me hz-panel__header hz-color-link hz-color-link--static hz-color-link--enabled " tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="hz-color-link__text " role="link" tabindex="0" data-unmask="false">I’m ready to sign up. Where do I start?</span><span class="icon-font icon-chevron_thin_right hz-panel__toggle hz-panel__toggle--right hz-color-link__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="hz-panel__content" aria-hidden="true"><div>Great! It’s easy to sign up here for the plan that best fits your needs. <a class='hz-pro-solutions-link hz-pro-solutions-link--blue hz-color-link hz-color-link--none hz-color-link--enabled hz-track-me' data-compid='demo_btn' href='https://www.houzz.com/signup/ps=1/u=aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuaG91enouY29tL2hvdXp6LXByby9wcmljaW5n/s=SG91enpQcm9QcmljaW5nUGFnZQ=' target='_blank'>Click here</a> to sign up.<br/>If you’d like to chat about custom advertising packages, or if you are an existing customer and would like to upgrade, please call <a class='hz-pro-solutions-link hz-pro-solutions-link--blue hz-color-link hz-color-link--none hz-color-link--enabled hz-track-me' data-compid='phone' href='tel: (888) 510-9389'>(888) 510-9389</a>. Or, <a class='hz-pro-solutions-link hz-pro-solutions-link--blue hz-color-link hz-color-link--none hz-color-link--enabled hz-track-me' data-compid='demo_btn' href='https://www.houzz.com/houzz-pro/demo-request?sourceCommandName=HouzzProPricingPage&sourcePageName=pricingPageV2' target='_blank'>click here</a> to schedule a brief call so we can get the right plan in place for you.</div></div></section></div><div data-pos-id="5" data-cta="Do I have to use all of the Houzz Pro features?"><section class="hz-panel hz-panel--collapsible hz-panel--collapsed"><button class="hz-panel__header-btn hz-track-me hz-panel__header hz-color-link hz-color-link--static hz-color-link--enabled " tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="hz-color-link__text " role="link" tabindex="0" data-unmask="false">Do I have to use all of the Houzz Pro features?</span><span class="icon-font icon-chevron_thin_right hz-panel__toggle hz-panel__toggle--right hz-color-link__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="hz-panel__content" aria-hidden="true"><div>Sure don’t! But every tool is designed to boost your business, so we think it’s a good idea to expand your Houzz Pro horizons. That said, if you have a favorite tool, feel free to keep using it and get to know other Houzz Pro features at your leisure.</div></div></section></div><div data-pos-id="6" data-cta="How long does it typically take a business to get up and running?"><section class="hz-panel hz-panel--collapsible hz-panel--collapsed"><button class="hz-panel__header-btn hz-track-me hz-panel__header hz-color-link hz-color-link--static hz-color-link--enabled " tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="hz-color-link__text " role="link" tabindex="0" data-unmask="false">How long does it typically take a business to get up and running?</span><span class="icon-font icon-chevron_thin_right hz-panel__toggle hz-panel__toggle--right hz-color-link__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="hz-panel__content" aria-hidden="true"><div>You get out what you put in! Luckily, Houzz Pro is expertly designed to be intuitive so you can hit the ground running in no time.</div></div></section></div><div data-pos-id="7" data-cta="Which integrations are available?"><section class="hz-panel hz-panel--collapsible hz-panel--collapsed"><button class="hz-panel__header-btn hz-track-me hz-panel__header hz-color-link hz-color-link--static hz-color-link--enabled " tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="hz-color-link__text " role="link" tabindex="0" data-unmask="false">Which integrations are available?</span><span class="icon-font icon-chevron_thin_right hz-panel__toggle hz-panel__toggle--right hz-color-link__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="hz-panel__content" aria-hidden="true"><div>We have several integrations to make your life easier, including QuickBooks Online, virtually all calendar apps, Gmail and Zoom.</div></div></section></div><div data-pos-id="8" data-cta="Can my team members and subcontractors use Houzz Pro?"><section class="hz-panel hz-panel--collapsible hz-panel--collapsed"><button class="hz-panel__header-btn hz-track-me hz-panel__header hz-color-link hz-color-link--static hz-color-link--enabled " tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="hz-color-link__text " role="link" tabindex="0" data-unmask="false">Can my team members and subcontractors use Houzz Pro?</span><span class="icon-font icon-chevron_thin_right hz-panel__toggle hz-panel__toggle--right hz-color-link__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="hz-panel__content" aria-hidden="true"><div>Absolutely. You can invite your team members and subcontractors to join you on Houzz Pro account, and control exactly what they can view or manage. There are endless features you can use to collaborate with your team in Houzz Pro, including Tasks, the Project Schedule, and Daily Logs. No more facilitating big projects through texts, emails, and calls.</div></div></section></div><div data-pos-id="9" data-cta="Can I communicate with my clients and control what they see?"><section class="hz-panel hz-panel--collapsible hz-panel--collapsed"><button class="hz-panel__header-btn hz-track-me hz-panel__header hz-color-link hz-color-link--static hz-color-link--enabled " tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><style data-styled="true" data-styled-version="5.3.11">.kIJmMR.hz-modal.EmbeddedCalendlyModal__StyledModal-sc-14s3j7i-0.hz-modal .hz-modal__container{width:100%;height:93%;top:unset;left:unset;bottom:0;-webkit-transform:none;-ms-transform:none;transform:none;}/*!sc*/
.kIJmMR.hz-modal.EmbeddedCalendlyModal__StyledModal-sc-14s3j7i-0.hz-modal .hz-modal__frame{width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:0;position:absolute;bottom:0;padding:0;}/*!sc*/
.kIJmMR.hz-modal .hz-modal__header-close{font-size:@header-3;top:0 !important;padding:0.75rem;z-index:1;}/*!sc*/
.kIJmMR.hz-modal.EmbeddedCalendlyModal__StyledModal-sc-14s3j7i-0.hz-modal .hz-modal__body{height:100%;margin-top:0;}/*!sc*/
data-styled.g37[id="EmbeddedCalendlyModal__StyledModal-sc-14s3j7i-0"]{content:"kIJmMR,"}/*!sc*/
</style><span class="hz-color-link__text " role="link" tabindex="0" data-unmask="false">Can I communicate with my clients and control what they see?</span><span class="icon-font icon-chevron_thin_right hz-panel__toggle hz-panel__toggle--right hz-color-link__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="hz-panel__content" aria-hidden="true"><div>Yes! Through the 24/7 Client Dashboard you can give your client access to all of their relevant documents, and preview the “client view” so you make sure they will only see what you want them to see. Did we mention this can greatly decrease client calls and texts since they can answer most of their own questions now? Phew!</div></div></section></div><div data-pos-id="10" data-cta="Can I send documents directly from Houzz Pro?"><section class="hz-panel hz-panel--collapsible hz-panel--collapsed"><button class="hz-panel__header-btn hz-track-me hz-panel__header hz-color-link hz-color-link--static hz-color-link--enabled " tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="hz-color-link__text " role="link" tabindex="0" data-unmask="false">Can I send documents directly from Houzz Pro?</span><span class="icon-font icon-chevron_thin_right hz-panel__toggle hz-panel__toggle--right hz-color-link__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="hz-panel__content" aria-hidden="true"><div>Of course! You can create and send professionally branded proposals, estimates, and invoices directly to your clients. Upload an unlimited number of documents to share and store. Add messages, images, and contract terms to documents, and save them as templates for future use. Or, create documents even faster with Houzz Pro’s preloaded templates.</div></div></section></div><div data-pos-id="11" data-cta="Does your software integrate with QuickBooks Online?"><section class="hz-panel hz-panel--collapsible hz-panel--collapsed"><button class="hz-panel__header-btn hz-track-me hz-panel__header hz-color-link hz-color-link--static hz-color-link--enabled " tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="hz-color-link__text " role="link" tabindex="0" data-unmask="false">Does your software integrate with QuickBooks Online?</span><span class="icon-font icon-chevron_thin_right hz-panel__toggle hz-panel__toggle--right hz-color-link__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="hz-panel__content" aria-hidden="true"><div>Houzz Pro software easily integrates with QuickBooks Online, to help you avoid duplicate entries. You’ll be able to sync your estimates and invoices in a snap. Your accountant will thank you.</div></div></section></div><div data-pos-id="12" data-cta="Does Houzz Pro have a mobile app?"><section class="hz-panel hz-panel--collapsible hz-panel--collapsed"><button class="hz-panel__header-btn hz-track-me hz-panel__header hz-color-link hz-color-link--static hz-color-link--enabled " tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="hz-color-link__text " role="link" tabindex="0" data-unmask="false">Does Houzz Pro have a mobile app?</span><span class="icon-font icon-chevron_thin_right hz-panel__toggle hz-panel__toggle--right hz-color-link__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="hz-panel__content" aria-hidden="true"><div>Yes! You can <a class='hz-pro-solutions-link hz-pro-solutions-link--blue hz-color-link hz-color-link--none hz-color-link--enabled hz-track-me' data-compid='demo_btn' href='https://www.houzz.com/for-pros/mobile-app' target='_blank'>download the Houzz Pro mobile app</a> for iOS on the Apple App Store or for Android on the Google Play Store, on your phone or tablet.</div></div></section></div><div data-pos-id="13" data-cta="How does Houzz protect my data?"><section class="hz-panel hz-panel--collapsible hz-panel--collapsed"><button class="hz-panel__header-btn hz-track-me hz-panel__header hz-color-link hz-color-link--static hz-color-link--enabled " tabindex="0" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="hz-color-link__text " role="link" tabindex="0" data-unmask="false">How does Houzz protect my data?</span><span class="icon-font icon-chevron_thin_right hz-panel__toggle hz-panel__toggle--right hz-color-link__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="hz-panel__content" aria-hidden="true"><div>We transmit data to users via industry-standard encrypted channels (e.g. our web pages are all HTTPS). We meet PCI-DSS security standards for accepting credit card payments. We store data in multiple locations with Amazon Web Services (AWS), which also manages disaster recovery and business redundancy. We also maintain encrypted back-ups of Houzz Pro data. Privacy and transparency are our guiding principles, even as we've grown to serve hundreds of thousands of customers. We believe that customer data belongs to the customer, and your personal and business data is yours.</div></div></section></div></section></div></section></section><div class="hz-pro-landing-schedule-demo  pricing-content__schedule-demo saas-mono" data-section="Main Content" data-container="Schedule Demo" data-event-type="Element Viewed" data-extra-info="{&quot;experienceName&quot;:&quot;pricing-v2&quot;}"><section class="marketing-container "><div class="hz-pro-landing-schedule-demo__content"><div class="hz-pro-landing-schedule-demo__subtitle">READY TO GET STARTED?</div><div class="hz-pro-landing-schedule-demo__title">Schedule your free demo</div><div class="hz-pro-landing-schedule-demo__button"><button class="btn  hz-pro-solutions-button hz-pro-solutions-button--primary-outline hz-track-me hz-pro-landing-schedule-demo__button__cta" role="button" data-event-type="Element Viewed" data-component="Demo Button" data-testid="demo-btn" target="_blank" type="button">Get Free Demo</button></div></div></section></div></section></div><footer class="sc-183mtny-0 fQLIGD hz-track-me" data-section="Footer" data-event-type="Element Viewed"><div display="flex" data-container="Footer Topics" class="sc-183mtny-0 gUClix"><div class="sc-183mtny-0 isNRJx">